upstream: https://docs.stripe.com/.well-known/skills/stripe-best-practices
index: https://docs.stripe.com/.well-known/skills/index.json
verified: 2026-08-16
scope: directory
reason: official hosted tax reference contains a malformed undefined Markdown target
note: references/tax.md remediation step 1 links back to its own
  `## Choosing a product tax code` section. The hosted source emitted
  `undefined#choosing-a-product-tax-code`; local uses the valid same-document
  target `#choosing-a-product-tax-code`.
would_lose_if_wired: an unguarded byte-for-byte refresh would restore the
  malformed target and fail repository Markdown-link validation.
refresh_guard: _refresh-vendored.sh skips this directory when .local-fork is
  present, before any fetch or write.
to_vendor: remove this ledger only after the official hosted tax reference uses
  a valid target and every indexed file is re-verified. No external publication
  was performed by this task.
